# Live deploy email summary

Whenever code is moved to the live servers (git push to main / Pages deploy and/or `npm run deploy:worker`), also email a plain-language summary of what shipped.

## How to send

Use Card Genie’s email path (not a personal mail client):

```bash
DEPLOY_NOTIFY_SECRET=… npm run notify:deploy -- "$(cat <<'EOF'
<summary matching the chat deploy summary>
EOF
)"
```

Or:

```bash
DEPLOY_NOTIFY_SECRET=… node scripts/notify-deploy.mjs --file /tmp/deploy-summary.txt
```

- **To:** `cardgenie@gcuniverse.com` (script default)
- **Subject:** `Card Genie latest code - <date/time>` (Pacific, auto-inserted by the script/API)
- **Body:** Same style of summary you just gave in chat (what was wrong, what changed, how to verify)

`DEPLOY_NOTIFY_SECRET` is a Wrangler secret on `cardgenie-api`. Endpoint: `POST /api/admin/deploy-summary`.

Do this as part of finishing the live move — not as a separate “want me to email?” question.
